WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.725
At Pragnya's Sunday outings, adults come to help with the kids.

2
00:00:05.075 --> 00:00:11.844
But “help out” is not a job. Instructions come fast. And the lead has to keep track of every kid.

3
00:00:12.994 --> 00:00:20.791
Helper Jobs is a simple app on one shared tablet. It gives each helper a real job, one step at a time.

4
00:00:21.141 --> 00:00:25.842
Let's follow Asha. Asha is made up, and so is everyone you will see.

5
00:00:27.292 --> 00:00:32.112
First, the volunteer lead chooses a PIN, and ticks who came today.

6
00:00:32.462 --> 00:00:38.956
Then the lead makes a match. Asha, the snack job, Eli, and Jordan, a volunteer close by.

7
00:00:39.906 --> 00:00:43.733
A job with a kid can't start without a volunteer nearby.

8
00:00:45.283 --> 00:00:48.315
Asha taps her picture. There is no password.

9
00:00:48.665 --> 00:00:50.934
The job the lead set up is at the top.

10
00:00:51.284 --> 00:00:56.135
Each step is one picture and a few words. She can tap Read aloud to hear it.

11
00:00:57.085 --> 00:01:04.379
Eli's snack card says a snack is okay. If a card says no snack, the steps change, so nobody has to guess.

12
00:01:05.629 --> 00:01:09.029
When she's done, she picks how it felt, and earns a star.

13
00:01:10.579 --> 00:01:15.472
If Asha needs help, she taps Help. It's in the same place on every screen.

14
00:01:16.122 --> 00:01:19.010
About a second later, it shows on the lead's phone.

15
00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:24.313
The lead taps I'm here, and can leave a short note for the coordinator.

16
00:01:26.063 --> 00:01:29.954
After twenty minutes on one job, the board says: offer a break.

17
00:01:30.804 --> 00:01:35.505
Ravi reads his steps in Hindi, with bigger text. Spanish works too.

18
00:01:36.455 --> 00:01:40.421
A helper can try the next job as a practice run, with no kid.

19
00:01:41.571 --> 00:01:46.312
At the end, the lead marks every kid back, before the outing can finish.

20
00:01:48.062 --> 00:01:51.773
Only the coordinator adds people, and records each yes.

21
00:01:52.523 --> 00:01:56.819
A photo, or a page for the family, only happens after a yes.

22
00:01:57.969 --> 00:02:04.711
If the tablet stops, there are paper job cards. And the coordinator's laptop keeps a locked copy.

23
00:02:06.461 --> 00:02:10.738
Helper Jobs is an early test. No outing has used it yet.

24
00:02:11.088 --> 00:02:14.979
We'd like to try it for three Sundays, with three to five helpers.

25
00:02:15.629 --> 00:02:18.139
Tell us what made the day easier, or harder.
